ogies that regulate nicotine biosynthesis activities in the tobacco plant, the Company has pioneered development of high-yield, proprietary reduced nicotine content (RNC) tobacco plants and clinically validated RNC cigarette products. The Company received the first and only FDA Modified Risk Tobacco Product (MRTP) authorization for a combustible cigarette in December 2021. The Company is a subsequent participating manufacturer under the Master Settlement Agreement (\"MSA\") and vertically integrated for the production of both its own products and contract manufacturing operations (\"CMO\"), which consist primarily of branded filtered cigars and conventional cigarettes.","context":"Our Business","section":"Item 2. Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","block":294,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-097172","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-14","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001347858","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1347858/000110465926097172/xxii-20260630x10q.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/6113a913c62ff88dd4ffbc1341140c7a3c929a2730908989ada4330b9fe1fe7c.bin","sha256":"6113a913c62ff88dd4ffbc1341140c7a3c929a2730908989ada4330b9fe1fe7c"}},{"id":"54a029bd6a627389f27bcdffaefaf52d0be29a44d1f17e1ffaea82979140b886","quote":"●Net revenues for the second quarter of 2026 were $2,864, a decrease of 29.9% from $4,083 in the prior year period.","context":"Financial Overview","section":"Item 2. Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations","block":296,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-097172","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-14","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001347858","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1347858/000110465926097172/xxii-20260630x10q.htm","rawPath":"se